On offer
    Say "The war on the continent of Adonis is doing great injustice to the warriors who have turned into casualties of war."
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "With the ceremony delayed, Rotten Eyes have seized this place and turned it into a situation which the warriors' spirits can't reside peacefully. I feel like I am turning into the dead being surrounded by this. If we do nothing, Rotten Eyes will take over the warriors' spirits soon.\n\nAs long as these Rotten Eyes exist, their spirits may not be able to sleep peacefully. I feel pathetic that there is nothing I can do."

